WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.450
This stormy weather...

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.970
Doesn't it remind you of when
we raced across the Pacific Ocean?

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:49.910
Sure does.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:57.710
Who gives a crap? Why did we
have to go by plane in a storm like this?!

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:00.560
Really, I can't understand rich people...

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:03.980
Aaah, save me!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.940
You know too well I have a fear of heights!

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:12.280
A journey isn't art until you add in the spice of a thrill!

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:16.500
Not to mention that a storm like
this best suits our meeting with Ralf.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:18.000
Why's that?!

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.110
The guy is like a storm,

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:23.010
and a fearsome one, at that.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.770
<i>Wow!</i> What's that?

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.360
That's Castle Jurgens—Ralf's residence.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.190
T-That's Ralf's house?!

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:34.450
The Jurgens family once owned this entire region.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:38.350
I hear locals call this place 'The Stronghold'.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.190
We've finally come for you, Ralf! Just you wait!

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:48.060
The Royal Blader!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:01.330
Now, now, what's this? If it isn't
Olivier-sama and Giancarlo-sama..!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.300
Long time no see, Johann.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.840
We're sorry to come uninvited!

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:05.940
Don't you worry.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.020
More importantly, hurry in, before you catch a cold!

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:12.270
Had you told me you were coming, I
would have gone and picked you up.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.840
So, what brings you here today?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:20.770
Right... Ralf's already been informed,
but we wanted him to meet these guys.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:22.680
'Sup.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.820
You came all the way here to
introduce your new servants to us?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.560
How rude of you, Johann.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.210
Yeah! We're...

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:35.620
There's no way we'd hire this squalid bunch.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.000
Hey!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.460
Appearances aside, they are here as our guests.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:43.650
And that's putting aside the fact that Ralf
and Kinomiya have supposedly met before.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.780
So please, treat them accordingly.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.160
Very well.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:49.870
Grr...

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.810
Tsk! What's with them?!

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.380
This is why I hate upper-class people!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.560
Thank you.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:09.520
Mm! If you want some nice tea,
pure, first-flush Darjeeling is the best.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.360
Every other brand has been
forbidden by Ralf-sama himself.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.110
And where would he be?

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:18.850
Well, he's currently preoccupied with another guest.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.410
Oh, someone came ahead of us?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.080
Could said guest be who I'm thinking of?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.340
Quite.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:32.440
I was ordered not to interrupt his meeting, no matter what,

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.590
but if it's for the two of you...

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:38.960
I'll go inform him of your arrival. Just a moment.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.930
Looks like we'll have to wait.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.540
Oh well.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.940
It might be a while, too, so prepare yourselves.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.830
Sure! I'll wait as long as I gotta!

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.880
As long as I get to battle him again..!

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:05.250
But even then, isn't he taking <i>waaay</i> too long?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.540
Yeah, we've been sitting here for over an hour.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:12.810
Maybe Ralf chose to run instead of fighting me.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:19.540
That can't possibly be. Last time you faced
one another, Ralf completely destroyed you.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.060
Don't say that!

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:25.560
It seemed that you had an idea
as to who this other guest was.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:29.120
Perhaps the identity of said guest is
the reason why we've waited so long?

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.320
You'll soon find out.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:34.920
All I can say is that this is a lucky coincidence for you.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.640
Or maybe a very unlucky one, hm?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:42.100
Bah! I can't sit around any longer!

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.520
Hey! Where are you off to?

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.000
Where else?! If he's not coming to see us, I'll go see him!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.290
Don't move.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:51.530
Kai...

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:55.010
This is an old castle. If you get lost, you're in for a bad time.

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:58.430
What's that supposed to mean?!
I have some beef to settle with Ralf!

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.830
I'm not gonna let this stop me!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.190
T-Takao!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:06.520
Fool.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.150
Alright, now what?

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:16.640
This castle is humongous. Where could Ralf be?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.240
Hiya there!

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.910
Hello?

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.250
Is anyone home?

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.290
Oh, Mr. Statue!

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.020
Where's Ralf?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.880
<i>Oh, in that room over there.</i>

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.200
Aha! Just kidding...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.880
I'm an idiot.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.440
Why am I talking to a statue?
It's not like it'll answer me, anyway.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.970
Ow, ow, ow...

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:51.010
Where am I?!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:57.650
T-That's..!

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.090
A slide?! Really, now?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.070
Checkmate.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:29.470
I give up! Really, there's no beating you in chess.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.760
I think you mean "in chess, either."

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.210
What, you wanna try me?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:39.110
Excuse me. Some guests have arrived.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.260
Let them in.

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:45.940
Olivier! Giancarlo! Long time no see.

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:48.300
I'm glad to see you're well.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.970
Hey, Johnny. I knew you were the one who showed up.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:57.580
They let us in earlier than expected, and
unsurprisingly, I see that Ralf has beat you again.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:05.580
Allow me to introduce the heir of McGregor Industrial—
the UK's biggest enterprise—Johnny McGregor.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:07.490
McGregor Industrial?!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:10.940
The same group that holds power in the British royal court?

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.760
Johnny, here we have...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.420
No need for introductions.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:17.200
From what I see, they're but a bunch of commoners.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:20.180
Why in the world did you bring them here?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.820
He really is the son of an industrial company...

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.040
Frankly, I don't like this guy at all.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.860
H-How deep does this go?!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.840
H-Hot! Hot!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.740
This is..?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.210
Takao!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.550
What are you doing, coming from there?

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:48.890
Are you okay?

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:50.460
Yeah, I'm fine!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.800
We finally meet again, Ralf.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.890
Who are you?

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:58.170
How could you forget?!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.770
It's me! Me! We fought on
the cruise ship! Takao Kinomiya!

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.040
Oh...

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.730
Back then...

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.030
Have you remembered?

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.820
One of the ruffians I defeated.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.530
So, what brings you here, exactly?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.670
Let me explain, Ralf.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:26.550
So, these are the people you wanted me to meet?

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:29.960
I came all the way here to get
a chance to fight you once more!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:35.810
And even then you made us wait. Then I almost
got sliced in half. And then I got burnt by a fireplace!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.200
Our castle's traps, built during
the Middle Ages, are still active.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.940
Still, I'm disappointed.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.110
What?!

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:46.300
I was looking forward to meeting such "unique" Bladers,

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:48.910
but in the end, it was only you...

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.740
Your first mistake was taking Olivier seriously.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:56.320
A softie like him couldn't recognize
a strong Blader if he tripped on one.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:00.250
For me, even one look is enough to say that among you,

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:02.780
there are no strong Bladers.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:04.280
What did you say?!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.660
You're as cruel as ever, huh?

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.500
Don't let it bother you. Johnny has a sharp tongue.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.470
That mouth of his...

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.870
He must be a Blader!

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:15.690
Let me tell you somethin'.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:21.760
I'm not the same guy I was before! I traveled
across Europe and got much, much stronger!

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.100
Fight me, Ralf!

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:24.350
I refuse.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:28.190
No matter the outcome, a battle is a one-time event.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.650
I won't fight the same opponent twice.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.520
W-What are you saying?!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:37.650
Beyblade is a battle between men,
fought on a battlefield, with one's life at stake.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.490
Victory means glory, and defeat means death.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.770
It's impossible to fight the dead.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.150
What kind of crap are you spouting?!

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.970
Stop blabbering on and fight me!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.720
Or could it be that you're scared of revenge?

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.890
I must not be getting through to you.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.560
Y-You wanna fight?!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:02.640
Come with me.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:09.490
Are you sure it's okay to show it to these guys, Ralf?

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.090
Come in.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.930
W-What's this?!

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:38.680
The Jurgens family has long been the
rulers of the land, and a dynasty of knights.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:43.690
Our ancestors got into these suits before battle.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:49.870
Together, they partook in countless
fights to defend their pride as knights.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:12:02.780
They won every battle they fought in, and
not once were they defeated by the enemy.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.160
The reason being...

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:10.880
Our ancestors had mastered
the control of the Sacred Beasts.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:27.930
Griffolyon's Bit, channeling the Sacred Beast's power,
has been handed down by the Jurgens for generations.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.730
And now, that same Bit...

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.050
is right in here.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.690
Now do you get it?

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:41.320
Griffolyon is the symbol of a proud knight.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:46.620
The Sacred Beast is the knight's servant,
and each Bey battle is a battle between knights.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:49.870
You're a small fry, defeated on the battlefield.

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:53.920
How do <i>you</i> plan to get your revenge on me?

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:58.350
Do you, perhaps, intend on asking
an evil spirit to bring you back to life?

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:01.230
Oh my. This is unusual.

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:03.960
A joke from the mouth of the oh-so-stiff Ralf.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.790
I knew it.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:10.810
Defeated by someone with such an arbitrary
mindset... I can see why Team Shadows resent you.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.510
Team Shadows?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.240
What's that?

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.620
A group possessed by evil after losing by your hand.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:19.620
Is that a joke?

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:23.560
I wouldn't joke about this.
What I just said is true.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.800
Ralf, you're mistaken.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:33.020
I don't care if you're a knight or
what... Beyblade is not a one-time thing.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.870
You can win, lose, and then win
again facing the same opponent...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.940
That way, both you and your friendships
grow! That's how it's supposed to be!

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.220
Foolish!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.230
I'm gonna teach you a lesson!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:48.610
It's useless, Takao. Ralf doesn't
even see you as an opponent anymore!

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:50.280
Hands off, Professor!

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.530
Then I'll take you on.

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.340
Rei!

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:55.070
I'm up for it as well.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.040
Max!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.410
Okay, okay...

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:01.160
I'll take you on.

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:06.170
I kept quiet until now, but after hearing
all that crap about growth and friendship,

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.410
I feel like I'm going to be sick.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.570
All of these delusions will be crushed.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:12.670
However...

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.700
My opponent will be <i>you</i>!

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:16.250
Kai will?!

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:20.180
I'd prefer to fight the one of you
with at least some sort of backbone.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.560
Sound good?

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:23.090
No.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:24.310
What?!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:30.640
I don't like you one bit. I'd rather fight
someone with at least some sort of backbone.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.580
And here I thought he was the silent type.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:40.020
He's even more sharp-tongued than Johnny...

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:47.070
Why you..! How <i>dare</i> you humiliate me like
this?! Even Her Majesty the Queen pays respect to me!

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:51.180
I suggest you go work on your
friendship with Her Majesty, then.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:55.600
That's enough!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.770
Johnny threw his gauntlet!

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:59.500
It's a request for a duel!

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:03.550
Very well. I'll take you on.

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:04.760
Kai!

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:07.110
Kai accepted the challenge?!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.160
Now that's a sight to see.

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:10.930
Kai is getting serious!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:16.570
I formally challenged him to a duel.
You can't complain, can you, Ralf?

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:20.830
I suppose not. So let us begin.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.890
Where are we?

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:31.250
This is Ralf's Beyblade training room.

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:35.740
He trains here day and night.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.820
I see...

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:47.550
In this confined space, he can
allow his Sacred Beast to go all-out.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.310
Fighters, to your shooting points!

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:51.170
Are you ready?

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.240
Yeah.

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.510
There's one thing I forgot to mention...

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.770
Ralf isn't the only knight around here.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.410
I, too..!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.610
I was given the title of Knight by the royal court!

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.910
Let's do this, Salamalyon!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:20.550
I will punish you in the name of Her Majesty the Queen!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.770
Sounds fun.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:26.880
Kai!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:28.100
Ready...

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.590
Three, Two, One!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:32.810
Go... Shoot!

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:44.730
It's keeping up with Dranzer!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.970
As expected, Johnny must be fairly powerful!

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:56.740
They're struggling to take the lead...
Are they equal in power?

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:59.500
This battle looks like it'll really drag on.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:01.560
No, I'll get this over with.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:07.090
If this were torture, I'd take my time. But this isn't torture...

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:08.970
It's an execution!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:13.220
Kai!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.000
Dranzer is being pushed back!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.660
Oh no!

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:19.770
I guess I'll have to hurry things up.

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.440
Dranzer!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.540
Alright! Go, Kai!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:39.280
Flame Saber!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.970
I see... I'm left with no choice.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.130
Salamalyon!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:00.100
That's..!

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:01.100
A Sacred Beast!

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:02.980
He called it Salamalyon?!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:09.890
What?!

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.030
Stopped in its tracks!

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:12.160
How can this be?!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.930
So hot! Where's that heat coming from?!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:22.110
It's the flames! Both Suzaku and
Salamalyon are Beasts of Fire!

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:24.860
Their power is filling the entire room!

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:29.870
And because of these stone walls,
the heat has no way to escape!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:34.760
At this rate, we'll all be burnt to a
crisp by the time it's said and done!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.270
Kai, don't give up!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.860
You've committed two sins.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:39.890
What did you say?!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.770
The first was insulting Her Majesty and I.

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:51.070
And the second was making me use the
Sacred Beast of Salamalyon against trash like you!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.730
You will pay for these sins with defeat!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.040
Fire Rod!

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:03.580
Suzaku!

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.020
Dranzer out!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.280
The winner is Johnny.

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.170
Kai..!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.380
Kai lost..!

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.330
No way! How could this happen?!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.660
I don't like it.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.480
Your shocked expression.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.780
As if you thought you could win against me!

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:46.910
First with chess, now this battle...
This has been an unpleasant day all around.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.250
I'm leaving.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.290
Johnny-sama!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.430
I thought you were staying the night.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:00.740
I changed my mind. Get the car.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.480
Wait, Johnny.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.610
You may leave.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.330
Very well, then.

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:12.170
Don't try to stop me. I've had enough...

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.120
Why did you use the Fire Rod?

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.380
Your Sacred Beast alone should have been enough.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.650
Fire Rod is your secret technique, is it not?

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.780
I don't know.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:22.610
What?

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:25.980
I don't know. I felt like I needed to use it.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.640
That's all.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:34.120
Now are you beginning to
understand why we brought them here?

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:39.420
Right. They possess a certain <i>je ne sais quoi</i> that we lack.

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:43.300
And that same something caused us many a problem.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:48.210
Are you going to shoo them away
before understanding the nature of it all?

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:57.920
Kai...

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.780
I can't believe that Kai lost...

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:02.020
What can we do now..?

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:05.320
Even my analysis is useless right now!

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.200
We can only get stronger.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:12.730
If they fight with the Sacred Beasts, then we'll have to get stronger with our own Sacred Beasts.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.210
Isn't that right, Takao?

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.610
Dang right.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:21.840
We'll get stronger, and then take our revenge!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:30.610
Let's get rid of this frustration together, Kai.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:00.270
According to my analysis, this is a big shock!

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:02.850
Kai lost! <i>Our </i>Kai!

00:23:02.850 --> 00:23:05.010
So we've come to a decision.

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:08.740
As the BBA team, we will fight with the Euro team.

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:13.470
But Ralf does not intend to accept our challenge.

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:17.420
Not only that, he refuses to put the Euro team back together!

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:20.980
Next time: The Strongest Euro Team is Formed!

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:24.230
Blader DJ... it's been a while since I saw him so excited.
